{"steamAppId":637670,"description":"Originally released in 1993, \"Secret of Mana\" is by far the most popular title in the “Mana” series. Now it's finally getting a long-awaited, full 3D remake!\n\nThe game faithfully retells the beloved story while adopting modern 3D graphics and controls. It will feature a newly arranged musical score, voiced characters and new content. \n\nThe adventure of Randi, Primm, and Popoi is reborn in the new \"Secret of Mana\"!\n\nKEY FEATURES:\n3D REMASTERED GRAPHICS\nThe world of MANA rebuilt in vivid 3D graphics.\n\nUPGRADED GAMEPLAY \nExciting new interlude episodes. \n\nLOCAL CO-OP\nPlay with your friends in three-player co-op mode!\n\nVOICED-CHARACTERS\nFinally hear the voices for iconic characters Randi, Primm, and Popoi along with many others!","short_description":"The memorable adventure of Randi, Primm and Popoi is reborn as Secret of Mana! Originally released in 1993, Secret of Mana is by far the most popular title in the “Mana” series and has now undergone a much-awaited full 3D remake!","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/637670/header.jpg?t=1776653917","developer":"Square Enix","publisher":"Square Enix","genre":"Экшены, Ролевые игры","platforms":["Windows"],"modes":["Один игрок","Многопользовательская","PvP на одном экране","Кооператив"],"playerCount":46,"releaseLabel":"15 фев. 2018 г.","comingSoon":false,"metacritic":null,"metacriticUrl":null,"steam":68,"steamReviewCount":2929,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/637670/ss_50e9d9f4ad8498d01f624258dc8b77ded1439985.600x338.jpg?t=1776653917","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/637670/ss_50e9d9f4ad8498d01f624258dc8b77ded1439985.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776653917"},{"id":1,"image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/637670/ss_38e047e521fd957cd4ee738908969ce70d5fcaae.600x338.jpg?t=1776653917","full":"https://sha